  <metadata>
    <name>Standard Chartered Hong Kong Marathon 2027 - Marathon 42.195 km (approximate)</name>
    <desc>APPROXIMATE track. Route order from the official 2027 marathon course map (same route as the 2026 Runner's Guide map) and the HK Transport Department road list for 2026, routed along OpenStreetMap roads incl. Stonecutters Bridge, Nam Wan Tunnel, Ting Kau Bridge, Cheung Tsing Tunnel and the Western Harbour Crossing, then shortened to the shortest line within 10 m of the road centreline (course-measurement style). U-turn points are best guesses tuned to the official elevation-profile landmarks. ele = official 2026 marathon course profile (1 km samples, vector data from the Runner's Guide PDF) mapped by distance fraction with PCHIP interpolation; no surface DEM is used, so the harbour tunnel dip (about -30 m) is kept. No official GPX was published as of 2026-10-26. Route data derived in part from OpenStreetMap (ODbL).</desc>
    <link href="https://www.hkmarathon.com/course-maps"><text>Official course maps</text></link>
    <time>2026-10-26T00:00:00Z</time>
  </metadata>
